<HelloFraandsPage updated="2026-10-28" title="Influencer agreement" summary="Influencer ke taur par aapki zimmedariyan aur shartein." review={true} related={[{ href: '/hosts/rules', label: 'Influencer rules' }, { href: '/hosts/agreement', label: 'Influencer agreement' }]}>
<h2>Your role</h2><p>You work as an independent contractor. You are not an employee of {BRAND.name}. You choose your available hours and remain responsible for your conduct and statements.</p>
<h2>Payment and conduct</h2><p>Payment is calculated under <a href="/hosts/rates">rates, withdrawals &amp; taxes</a>. You must meet the <a href="/hosts/requirements">influencer requirements</a> and follow the <a href="/hosts/rules">influencer rules</a>. Nobody else may use your account to take calls.</p>
<h2>Safety</h2><p>Every call is recorded for safety, and nobody listens live. After the call an AI system checks the recording, and only named members of our safety team can read the text of a flagged call. See the <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a> for what we keep and for how long. Both numbers are masked, and pressing # ends the call and blocks the other person. See the <a href="/safety">safety centre</a>.</p>
<h2>Call rules you accept</h2><p>You accept the call rules when you sign up in the app, before you send your profile for approval. If you joined earlier, you accept them once before you can go online again. The rules: do not sell on a call (use the {BRAND.name} Shop instead), never take or ask for payment outside {BRAND.name}, do not share contact details, and be respectful. Financial tips, loans, network marketing and adult services are not allowed.</p>
<h2>Wellbeing duties</h2><p>You follow the <a href="/hosts/crisis-script">welfare &amp; crisis guide</a>. You give no medical, medicine, legal, money or relationship advice. You do not flirt, form a romantic relationship, share contact details or meet callers. You do not keep a distressed or attached caller on the line to earn more minutes, or encourage a caller to depend on you — doing so is a removal offence. You flag welfare and attachment concerns promptly so the platform can act.</p>
<h2>Strikes, pauses and bans</h2><p>A strike is for one call. It counts for 90 days. Three active strikes pause your account: you are hidden from Reels and search, calls and new bookings stop, and booked calls are cancelled with a full refund to the fans' wallets. You can appeal each strike once, by replying APPEAL on WhatsApp or with the Appeal button. Only a person on our team can ban an account. A ban is permanent, and the phone number cannot be used to sign up again.</p>
<h2>Suspension and termination</h2><p>Rule breaches can lead to a warning, strike, pause or removal. Serious safety concerns may require immediate action. While your account is paused, your earnings are held until our review ends. If a ban is confirmed, fans of the flagged calls are refunded first from the held money, and the rest is paid to your UPI ID as for a closed account. A report alone does not forfeit earnings. You may stop taking calls and request account closure.</p>
<h2>Responsibility for your words</h2><p>To the extent allowed by law, you agree to cover the platform's losses and reasonable costs arising from your unlawful statements or your breach of these rules. This does not remove rights that the law gives you.</p>
<h2>Disputes</h2><p>Contact <a href="/grievance">the grievance contact</a> first. Both sides will try mediation before court proceedings. Indian law applies, subject to mandatory legal rights.</p>
</HelloFraandsPage>
